---
source: crates/ccs/src/ui.rs
expression: terminal.backend()
---
"   ╭ ctrl-space ───────────────────────────╮"
"   │        1-9 ➜ go to session            │"
"   │          , ➜ previous session         │"
"   │          . ➜ next session             │"
"   │          n ➜ new session              │"
"   │          N ➜ new session, no worktree │"
"   │          f ➜ find a session           │"
"   │          m ➜ commit & merge           │"
"   │          c ➜ Chat                     │"
"   │          r ➜ review                   │"
"   │          s ➜ shell                    │"
"   │          [ ➜ previous tab             │"
"   │          ] ➜ next tab                 │"
"   │      Enter ➜ reload tab               │"
"   │          q ➜ quit                     │"
"   ╰ Esc cancel ───────────────────────────╯"
